    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つめたい　うみにしか　すまないと\nかんがえられてきた。　アローラに\nあらわれる　りゆうは　ナゾ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "차가운 바다에서만 산다고\n추정되었다. 알로라에\n나타나는 이유를 알 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人們一向認為牠只棲息在\n寒冷的海域，沒人知道牠\n出現在阿羅拉的原因。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tout le monde pensait qu’il ne pouvait survivre\nque dans les mers froides.\nPersonne ne sait donc ce qu’il fait à Alola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bisher wurde vermutet, dass es ausschließlich\nin kalten Gewässern lebe. Warum es auch in\nAlola auftaucht, ist noch ein Rätsel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre se ha creído que solo puede subsistir\nen aguas frías. El motivo de su aparición en\nAlola es un misterio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Finora si pensava che i Seel potessero vivere\nsolo nei mari gelidi, pertanto la loro comparsa\nad Alola è alquanto misteriosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has always been supposed that Seel live only\nin cold seas. Their having shown up in Alola is\na mystery.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "冷たい　海にしか　棲まないと\n考えられてきた。　アローラに\n現れる　理由は　ナゾ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "人们一直以为它只生活在寒冷的海域。\n它出现在阿罗拉的原因是个谜。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre se ha creído que solo puede subsistir\nen aguas frías. El motivo de su aparición en\nAlola es un misterio.",
      "language": {
